er><strong class=3D"style_chapter__grtAe">02</strong><h1>Gmail Smart Compos=
e</h1></header><h2 id=3D"introduction">Introduction</h2>
<p>Gmail's Smart Compose feature [1] assists users by suggesting the next f=
ew words as they write an email. This chapter explores this feature and exa=
mines the Transformer architecture that powers most generative systems.</p>
