ectangular boxes, resembling keyboard keys, are arranged horizontally. Each=
 box contains a single character from the input string 'Let's go!', represe=
nting the individual tokens resulting from the character-level tokenization=
. The order of characters in the boxes mirrors the order in the input strin=
