vel tokenization</figcaption></div></figure>
<h5 id=3D"word-level-tokenization">Word-level tokenization</h5>
<p>Word-level tokenization breaks text into individual words. While there a=
re different algorithms for word-level tokenization, a simple algorithm is =
to split the text using its whitespaces.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
