<h4 id=3D"combining-various-inputs">Combining various inputs</h4>
<p>In traditional ML, the model's architecture typically depends on the typ=
e of data it processes. This requires customized preprocessing and feature =
engineering for different data types like text, images, or tables.</p>
<p>In the era of GenAI, however, the model architecture is often decoupled =
from the input structure. This decoupling increases flexibility, allowing t=
he same model architecture to handle diverse inputs with a unified architec=
ture, thus streamlining development and enhancing the versatility of GenAI =
systems. This decoupling is done through techniques like prompt engineering=
 [25]. In Chapter 6, we examine prompt engineering in detail.</p>
