ution for the next token. Beam search selects the top three tokens with the=
 highest probabilities.</li>
<li><strong>Expansion:</strong> For each top three sequence, pass it to the=
 model and obtain the probabilities of the next token.</li>
<li><strong>Pruning:</strong> Select the top three sequences based on their=
 cumulative probabilities.</li>
</ol>
